  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1632/46/perkumpulan_senapan_daffa_20apng-png.png\" alt=\"替代文本\"></p>\n<h1>Kofi： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdaffatheone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/daffatheone</a></h1>\n<h1>PayPal： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fDaffatheOne\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://paypal.me/DaffatheOne</a></h1>\n<p><strong>如果遇到<span style=\"color:#ff0fbd\">紫色棋盘格</span>……你可以从 JAR 文件中取出 \"daffas\" 文件夹，并将其放入 \"tacz\" 文件夹中</strong></p>\n<p><strong>使用前请确保已安装 TACZ！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>建议在 FOV 设置为 90 时游玩，以确保准星位置正确！</strong></p>\n<p><strong>这是一个模组……请将其安装至 mods 文件夹</strong></p>\n<h3>感谢捐赠：Sabastien, Antony, Monica</h3>\n<h1>介绍 Daffa 的军火库</h1>\n<p>唯一一款能带来接近最新《使命召唤》游戏射击手感的 TACZ 插件。</p>\n<p>是的</p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KJVyPSFGFNA\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3NdvrUsqil4\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>武器列表</h1>\n<h3>HK-416</h3>\n<h3>以及更多</h3>\n<h1>配件列表</h1>\n<h3>以及更多</h3>\n<h1>致谢</h1>\n<h3>DaffaTheOne（枪械包）</h3>\n<h3>Corrineduck（编译）</h3>",
